{"title":"关于开展2023-2024年度项目管理优秀单位和个人评选活动的通知","date":"2024-02-26","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 22pt; font-family: 方正小标宋简体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">关于开展<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023-2024</span>年度项目管理优秀单位和个人评选活动的通知</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 22pt; font-family: 方正小标宋简体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-weight: normal;\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 44pt; line-height: 28pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 22pt; font-family: 方正小标宋简体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312\">各有关单位：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">为贯彻落实党的二十大精神和</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">年广东省高质量发展大会精神，紧扣高质量发展主题，以创新驱动发展为核心战略，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15.5pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">树立项目管理行业标杆，表彰项目管理先进典范，发挥其引领、带头作用，全面提升行业竞争力。</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">根据我省实际情况，广东省项目管理协会决定在全省范围内开展</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2023</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&mdash;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">年度项目管理优秀单位及个人的评选活动。现</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">就相关工作通知如下：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n黑体\">一、评选范围<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:楷体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n楷体\">（一）优秀项目管理单位<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">凡在广东省内登记注册、具有法人资格，从事项目管理相关工作满五年以上，无违法犯罪记录的单位，均可参加评选。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:楷体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n楷体\">（二）优秀项目管理个人<b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">凡在广东省内从事项目管理相关工作满八年以上，无违法犯罪记录的个人，均可参加评选。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 黑体;\">二、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 黑体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">评选条件<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:楷体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n楷体\">（一）优秀项目管理单位<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">认真贯彻执行项目管理方面的方针政策、法律法规和标准规范，遵守行规行约，诚实守信，无不良行为记录，社会信誉度高；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">在行业内改革与发展中贡献突出，能够自觉维护行业的社会形象，在行业内起到模范带头作用；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">单位领导集体团结协作、廉洁自律，具有较强的凝聚力与责任感，管理制度健全；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">维护职员合法权益，鼓励职员学习、掌握行业新技术，高级技术人员占比高，整体素质良好，有较强的团队合作精神，科技创新力度大，知识产权保护较好；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">5.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">对社会贡献较大，行业代表性强，创新能力、品牌形象、社会效益和经济效益在本地区或本系统名列前茅；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">6.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">积极履行社会责任，热心公益事业，主动参加各类社会责任活动。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:楷体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n楷体\">（二）优秀项目管理个人<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">遵纪守法，爱岗敬业，热爱行业工作，有良好的职业道德和社会信誉；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">诚实守信，无违规违纪不良行为记录，期间曾获当地政府部门、行业协会或主流媒体等颁发的奖项或表彰证书；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">坚持社会主义价值观，具有较强的事业心和责任感，在业内影响力较高，项目管理经验和能力较强；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">工作精益求精，在项目管理专业理论研究和业务工作中贡献突出，科技创新能力强，期间项目管理业绩显著。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 黑体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">三、评选程序<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">协会秘书处受理申报材料后，对申报材料进行初审，将通过初审的申报材料提交评审委员会进行评选。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">评审委员会核实申报有关信息，并根据专业化程度、行业代表性、项目管理业绩、综合竞争力、业界影响力和创新发展潜力等各项指标，对申报单位和个人进行综合评选，评选出优秀单位和优秀个人候选名单。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">候选名单</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">在协会网站和公众号上公示，公示期</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">5</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">天。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">公示无异议的，经协会审批后，对外公布评选结果。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 黑体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">四、报名方式<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">申报单位和个人须在</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">3</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">22</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">日</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">前将以下申报材料电子版发送至协会邮箱</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">gpma@vip.163.com</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">，邮件以</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">评选活动</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">+</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">单位名称</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">/</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">个人姓名</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">形式命名；申报材料纸质原件邮寄至：广州市天河区华强路</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">9</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">号保利中盈大厦</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2508</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">房，收件人罗小姐</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">13237101064</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">。逾期不予受理。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">《</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2023-2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">年度广东省项目管理优秀单位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">/</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">优秀个人申报表》（附件）；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">单位申报须提供单位营业执照（副本）或法人登记证书（副本）复印件（加盖公章）；个人申报须提供身份证复印件。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">有关佐证材料，包括但不限于单位或个人的获得各类标准认证、荣誉奖项、技术专利、学术著作及业绩案例等证明材料复印件。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 黑体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">五、其他<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:\r\nexactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">凡被评为项目管理优秀单位</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">和个人的，由协会颁发&ldquo;优秀项目管理单位&rdquo;、&ldquo;优秀项目管理个人&rdquo;奖牌和荣誉证书。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">评选活动以自愿申请、自愿提交申报材料为原则，不收取任何费用。申报材料概不退回。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（联系人：罗小姐；联系电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16pt;\">13237101064</span><span style=\"text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.6667px;\">附录：</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.6667px;\"><a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202402/%EF%BC%88%E7%B2%A4%E9%A1%B9%E7%AE%A1%E5%8D%8F%E3%80%942024%E3%80%952%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%BC%80%E5%B1%952023-2024%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%A6%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BC%98%E7%A7%80%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%84%E9%80%89%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5.pdf\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\">1、原文件</span></a></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.6667px;\"><a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202402/%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B6%202023-2024%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%A6%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BC%98%E7%A7%80%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E4%BC%98%E7%A7%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E8%A1%A8.docx\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\">2、</span></a></span><a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202402/%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B6%202023-2024%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%A6%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%BC%98%E7%A7%80%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%E4%BC%98%E7%A7%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%B3%E6%8A%A5%E8%A1%A8.docx\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\">优秀单位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">优秀个人申请表</span></span></a></span></span></p>"}